<title>USA: Brinkley SD B, Ark., won by First Commercial.</title>
<headline>Brinkley SD B, Ark., won by First Commercial.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Commerical Trust said it won $1.740 million of Brinkley SD B, Ark., limited tax refunding bonds,with a net interest cost of 4.7166 percent.</p>
</text>
